Demo models from KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Assets (github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Assets), glTF-Binary variants.
Licence: CC0 1.0 (BoomBox: Microsoft, Avocado: Microsoft); per-model source URL and author are in each manifest.json.
Layout: vertices.bin (f32 pos3 nrm3 tan4 uv2), indices.bin (u32), <slot>.rgba8 (RGBA8 mip chain in the layout and gob height its manifest entry records), manifest.json.
Convert: pip install numpy Pillow; python3 -I scripts/gltf_to_raw.py Model.glb demos/assets/<name> --max-size 256 --block-linear --readme README.md
BoomBox is converted with --max-size 256 (512 would be 5.8 MB), Avocado with 256.
